# L §6.4 (a move the scenario declares books nothing before D, LOAD-SCENARIO where load sees the day), §8.3 item 9
# (tally 2.1.6, issue #75): gift[2026-06] books on start_of(m), a day load sees, before raised's from 2027-01-01,
# so raised is refused at load, though q_raised reads nothing gift books. tally 2.1.5's refcore refused it only as
# the walk reached the instance, so q_raised answered 300.00 PLN. T's held scen/scenario-move; the engine's bytes.
=== model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T's base for M0's load-code fixtures (invented): a model and a scenario over it, scen.tally; it loads clean"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input amt: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN = amt + amt at reader

ask q: doubled law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
=== scen.tally
scenario raised over household
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version raise_2027
  cite card
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-02-01
  replace amt = 150.00 PLN "a raise from 2027"

version gifts
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-02-01
  gift_amt = 10.00 PLN "a gift"

ask q_raised: doubled in raised law 2027-06-01

index gm = month 2026-06..2026-06

input gift_amt: money PLN

move gift[m in gm]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount gift_amt
=== expect q_raised
scenario raised: refused: LOAD-SCENARIO move gift of raised books on 2026-06-01, before 2027-01-01 (scen.tally:23)
warning: WARN-UNREAD place konto is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD place world is read by nothing
